"text": "[image: 40 days out, and we're not slowing down. Ben and I are talking to voters across Nebraska, from Valentine to Hastings and Scottsbluff to Lincoln - and it's worth every mile. Let's get it done!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Ddrt6x0m7TT/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Great to be in Humboldt today for the Richardson County Fair Parade -- and even better to be in my running mate Ben Steffen's hometown! Thank you to everyone who came out and welcomed us. There's nothing like a Nebraska small-town parade.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Ddcg9jRm7tp/"
},
{
